; FBX 7.4.0 project file
; ------------------------------------------------------------------
; Hand-written ASCII FBX TEST FIXTURE for the 门户 FBX 转换器 sub-app.
;
; WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: the converter's whole promise is "FBX in, GLB out,
; animations intact", and this repo has no browser, so the only way to prove
; that promise on the CPU side is to ship a tiny FBX that the SAME vendored
; FBXLoader/GLTFExporter can chew through in Node (scripts/verify-fbx2glb.mjs
; runs the real pipeline over this exact file). It is also the app's
; 「载入样例」 button, so the UI can be exercised on a phone with no file at hand.
;
; WHAT IT CONTAINS (deliberately shaped like a Mixamo download, only tiny):
;   * a 2-bone armature (mixamorigHips -> mixamorigSpine) under a Null "Armature"
;   * a box mesh SKINNED to those two bones (clusters + bind pose + weights)
;   * one material
;   * TWO animation stacks, BOTH named "mixamo.com" — the real Mixamo take name,
;     which is exactly why the converter renames clips after the file by default
;     and why its dedupe path (mixamo.com, mixamo.com.001 …) has to exist
;   * the two clips animate DIFFERENT track kinds (rotation + translation)
; It is 8 vertices / 6 quads: enough to exercise skin+animation+material through
; the loader and the exporter, small enough to read.
; ------------------------------------------------------------------

